        Free Draft-and-Verification: Toward Lossless Parallel Decoding for Diffusion Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+S">Shutong Wu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+J">Jiawei Zhang</a>
      
